  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01V0">Lemma <span data-tag="01V0">29.33.10</span>.</a> Let $X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $g : S' \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $X' = X_{S'}$ be the base change of $X$. Denote $g' : X' \to X$ the projection. Then the map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  (g')^*\Omega _{X/S} \to \Omega _{X'/S'}  \]
</div>
  <p> of Lemma <a href="/tag/01UV" data-tag="01UV">29.33.8</a> is an isomorphism. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
